{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:44756ea4a9e282ff593ee4befd6d59adb69d550b52f7467e5a35eee2435c8414",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_12:1_2_030_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e78ad83f2e90b50e6215305c70e71d7b3c30288178d431e1c822ef18ef4138e3",
      "text": "最想吃的蛋糕是",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_12:1_2_030_12_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5eb4f58e16e9251fb48916f07d01615fb90f5978dea986b8b2eff6e0f2313b47",
      "text": "离自己的生日还有一个月的某天，\n卷绪向制作人倾诉自己在为和家人一起吃的\n生日蛋糕而烦恼。\n虽然家人跟他说挑卷绪自己最想吃的蛋糕就行，\n但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_12:1_2_030_12_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e4237acc3853743f0ccfb9cb51180b583f7d8126394258b9112df4017c246f8",
      "text": "约定之日已然临近……\n今宵必为卷绪祝贺，举办盛大之盛宴！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_12:1_2_030_12_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d373072fbf12e3306db0c5f9cdfa9dd92e76de73a4210d5fc012a893799b668",
      "text": "嗯！派对的准备和\n礼物的准备都搞定啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_12:1_2_030_12_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52a368be6719a4b6e9013ee623e446f962ea15233134259f662cb58006511233",
      "text": "这次的生日蛋糕，\n卷卷肯定也会超级开心的吧～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_12:1_2_030_12_a:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4042d7241ef96122c42e762c01d4d37b6b450d8c8d62abd30077230c47791556",
      "text": "他高兴的模样已经浮现在眼前了。\n真想早点让他吃上呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_12:1_2_030_12_a:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b028abcbd2917af63bebaf18157c66ebb107ba37b89bbc9591ed49876c62de82",
      "text": "嗯，是呢。\n等时间到了，我们就去Cafe Parade吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_12:1_2_030_12_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9df434b0e58e20f8e7a97039a55d3a1849be66d3056a1a17834064d0ec4e40ef",
      "text": "终于到派对当天了呢。\n生日快乐，卷绪。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_12:1_2_030_12_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f2c8f55fb9cae95f43e9f95b3e011d9c29482677c18cbde103fd73f0723ff75",
      "text": "好的，非常感谢！神谷先生\n一起端上来的红茶我也很期待。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_12:1_2_030_12_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7561699978582e4a6b3b3f4722fe65dabd9d8e1c05023b1f465b863ac9ce700b",
      "text": "神谷先生挑选的红茶和\n甜点的绝配搭配，可是最棒的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_12:1_2_030_12_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc75d5e42bf0bf822e7e10064d6fe38a2ccc29536b1f5591307440bd2bb26ddb",
      "text": "虽然自夸有点不好意思，\n但我相信这次也是个绝妙的组合哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_12:1_2_030_12_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:883b824134f6ad8d589f810eff9a9cd7b323ffa0ed8c995d112e6bf307bdcb87",
      "text": "哇，真的吗……！\n越来越期待了♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_12:1_2_030_12_c:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2b206e203b96fa4ccd130159b35c120b52a6c07418a490e54e3059f111557b4",
      "text": "今年庄一郎先生的蛋糕会是什么呢，\n我从好几天前就一直非常好奇了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_12:1_2_030_12_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:affafe5429ed89a7fc9605e61eb54eab88f8974265230b763c24f786ac47c087",
      "text": "虽然现在就想问，\n但是，在亲眼见到之前我要忍耐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_12:1_2_030_12_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14ceda037d579ae8a1900a41556c7d48670354f04f52a41416f41558b4222a96",
      "text": "请好好期待吧。\n我一定会让卷绪先生大吃一惊的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_12:1_2_030_12_c:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:010a846c9107abe0b17a16b2fef3945373e3be11f323c1422d647aba439d2ea7",
      "text": "好！\n好兴奋啊，会是什么样的蛋糕呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_12:1_2_030_12_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:900548047a95421a580e3b172c8b075bac1b163fee47c331d256dfde9f326c6e",
      "text": "呵呵。你能这么说，\n我准备起来也更有干劲了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_12:1_2_030_12_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1faec63a334280e9f887d0b5fa1cbd903a03f436da4c21c98481922e6425352",
      "text": "配得上祝祭之\n诸般供物已然精炼完成，卷绪啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_12:1_2_030_12_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b72c2dfb9883b012099de385d13604762dd10c7af4535b635b2fa7f6150a7a6b",
      "text": "为祝贺汝之生诞，\n撒旦已将强绝之魔力赐予吾身。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_12:1_2_030_12_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b89bb3d44335c088b1e9cd6a731fa5f280a2595261faec3bb90f40d180471d9b",
      "text": "故而此番供物，\n可称已达更深邃之深渊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_12:1_2_030_12_d:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b046592694b344c38ad1ccc2a547baee6c544c7894d18e39da7839e4c60f601",
      "text": "一定是超级厉害的料理\n没错了，真期待！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_12:1_2_030_12_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83ff23def9a9716508a2365c152fe57b6b17dc4a3c80eece2c50c2c9e08b43af",
      "text": "为了能多吃一点，\n我会把肚子空出来过去的♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_12:1_2_030_12_d:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2ffc3bcb3ab3aa23829b93ebd3a08b2e30faed00a29cd71945d951311ab270a",
      "text": "库库库……借吾之精炼术所诞之神秘风味，\n尽情品味享用至心满意足吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_12:1_2_030_12_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7902c4825a89e8228b7c6c52234b4c846dcb84d4e4ade10cfa522531cb9740ed",
      "text": "生日快乐！\n今年也能为卷卷庆祝，超级开心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_12:1_2_030_12_e:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc6733573cb4a70c0e23c1617c730fcf0a356c1cc93fe0d407c0ad96e70ce8a6",
      "text": "我也是，能得到咲酱的\n庆祝超开心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_12:1_2_030_12_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc9ccad624e37d46f73a77bf033ad76903a92853c3fcb4615b42b55608662ea9",
      "text": "好想早点把礼物送出去，\n看看卷卷吃惊的表情呀。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_12:1_2_030_12_e:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:184e5f27b41ee88bf481e73da6e13ecbc91d9df26b5e15923a349cb3d6a0f780",
      "text": "到派对结束之前\n都不可以掉以轻心哦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_12:1_2_030_12_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90e617f295d422981257a26ac1fee43286ed608dd6594a83392d167aaa53586f",
      "text": "嗯！\n我会期待你们会怎样给我惊喜的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
